  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cash Consortium of Sudan - Closed</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project improves coordination and delivery of harmonised cash and market assistance across Sudan, leveraging the consortium approach. By applying global best practices and addressing barriers to digitisation, it delivers efficient, impactful aid while emphasising accountability, localisation, and quality programming. Responding to conflict, displacement, economic crisis, and climate risks, the initiative supports resilience and meets vulnerable communities&apos; priority needs through market-based mechanisms.</narrative>
  </description>
